0..75 Comment "// A program hands the host a universal whose domain states no compactness,"
76..108 Comment "// and `admit` refuses the plan."
109..111 Comment "//"
112..189 Comment "// The plan is the plan of `∀ x ∈ [0, 1] (x · x < 2)` in `forall.gandr`,"
190..267 Comment "// except for its domain. The domain states its overtness at the reference 1,"
268..345 Comment "// and no compactness. A universal holds only by a cover of a compact domain,"
346..423 Comment "// so it names the compactness at the reference 2 as its evidence. The domain"
424..499 Comment "// does not state that evidence, so the validation pass refuses the plan at"
500..556 Comment "// the universal, node 5, by the check `DomainEvidence`."
557..559 Comment "//"
560..634 Comment "// `gandr run missing-compactness.gandr` writes the refusal as one line on"
635..702 Comment "// standard error. The run stops at `admit`, and it prints nothing."
703..705 Comment "//"
706..785 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/reals/forall.gandr` — the universal with its evidence"
786..864 Comment "// - see: `crates/theory-exact-reals/src/validate.rs` — the checks of a plan"
